<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">RRK60.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YAKOBO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha eyaahandiikirwe Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAKOBO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:1">1 Pet 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo, omuhuuku wa Ruhanga na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, naabahandiikira nimbaramutsya, imwe enganda ikumi na ibiri ezaataataine.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugumisiriza okugyezibwa n'okwohibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:6">1 Pet 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beishe-emwe, ku muraagume mwahikwaho okugyezibwa kw'emiringo etari emwe, mukutware nk'okushemererwa buzima; <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ahakuba nimumanya ngu okugyezibwa omu kwikiriza kwanyu kurugamu okugumisiriza. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Kandi murekye okugumisiriza kuhitsye omurimo gwakwo, naimwe mubone kuba abahikire omuri byona, mutaine ki mubuzirweho.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 2:3-6">Enf 2:3-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuriimwe ku haraabe harimu obuzirwe obwengye, abushabe Ruhanga, oha boona n'omutima ogutarikwima, n'obu kwakuba okweshaanya, kandi aryabuheebwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mak 11:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ashabe aine okwikiriza, atarikubanganisa, ahakuba orikubanganisa naashusha nk'ekingonzi ky'enyanja ekirikutwarwa omuyaga oku n'oku. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Kandi omuntu ogwo arekye kuteekateeka ngu Mukama naija kumuha ekintu kyona; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />ahakuba aine emitima ebiri, kandi omu mihanda ye taine hu ahamiire.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:5">Yak 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ow'eishe-emwe omworo ayehimbise. Ahabw'okutunguurwa kwe; <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:24">1 Pet 1:24</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'omutungi ayehimbise ahabw'okugarurwa ahansi, ahakuba aryahunduuka nk'orurabyo rw'obunyaatsi. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6">Isa 40:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu omu kasheeshe eizooba riija n'omushana gurikwotsya, guhonzya obunyaatsi, orurabyo rwabwo ruragara, n'oburungi bwabwo buhwaho. Nikwo n'omutungi arihunduuka omu mihanda ye.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emiizire y'ekibi n'omuheru gwakyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 5:4">1 Pet 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:11">Kush 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu orikugumisiriza omu kugyezibwa aine omugisha; ahakuba ku arisingura, aryaheebwa ekirunga ky'amagara, eki Ruhanga yaaraganiise abarikumukunda. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Omuntu weena ku araayohibwe, arekye kugira ati: Naayohibwa Ruhanga; ahakuba Ruhanga tabaasa kwohibwa kibi, kandi nawe tayosya muntu; <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7-10">Rom 7:7-10</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omuntu weena ayohibwa, yaabeihwabeihwa okwetenga kwe, kwamwosyosya. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Bwanyima okwetenga okwo, ku kuheza kutwara enda, kuzaara ekibi; n'ekibi ku kikura, kizaara okufa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />B'eishe-emwe abarikukundwa, mutabeihwabeihwa; <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:5">1 Yoh 1:5</ref>. </char></note> engabirano yoona enungi n'ekiconco kyona ekihikire biruga omu iguru, nibishuuma okuruga ahari Isheboona, Omuhangi w'ebirikwaka, otahindahinduka na kakye, n'obu kwakuba okugira ekicuucu ekireetwa okuhinduka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:23">1 Pet 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okukunda kwe akatuzaaza ekigambo ky'amazima, ngu tube nk'emijigaijo y'ebi yaahangire.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Eki nimukimanya, B'eishe-emwe abarikukundwa; omuntu weena arahukye kuhurira, kwonka atarahukiiriza kugamba, n'okugira ekiniga; <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />ahakuba ekiniga ky'omuntu tikikora by'okuhikiirira kwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:8">Kol 3:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwiheho ekihagaro kyona n'obubi oburengyesereize; mwakiire n'obucureezi ekigambo ekibyairwe omuriimwe, ekirikubaasa kujuna amagara gaanyu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:26">Mat 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:13">Rom 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi mube abarikworobera Ekigambo, beitu ti kukihurira kwonka, mukeebeiha. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ahakuba omuntu weena ku aba omuhurizi w'Ekigambo, ataakyorobera, ashusha nk'omuntu orikwereebera omu ndeeberwamu oku arikushusha ahamaisho; <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />akiheza kwereeba, yaagyenda, ahonaaho akeebwa oku arikushusha. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:12">Yak 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:2">Rom 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ogwo orikwetegyereza ebiragiro ebihikire eby'obusingye, akabyezirikira, atari orikubihurira keebwa, kureka ari omukozi orikubyorobera, omuntu ogwo aryaheebwa omugisha omu kukora kwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:13">Zab 34:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena ku ayeteekateekaho kuba omunyadiini, ataarinda rurimi rwe, yaayebeiha omu mutima gwe, ediini y'omuntu ogwo n'eya busha. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ediini eshemeire, etaine kamogo omu maisho ga Ruhanga Isheboona niyo egi: okutaayaayira efuuzi n'abafaakazi omu busaasi bwabo, n'okwerinda okugira amabara g'ensi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okutashoroora mu bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />B'eishe-emwe, mutariikiriza Mukama waitu ow'ekitiinisa, Yesu Kristo, kandi mukashoroora omu bantu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Mbwenu omuntu ku yaakwija ahu muteeraniire, ajwaire empeta z'ezaabu n'ebijwaro ebirikwengyengyeta, kandi haija omworo ojwaire emyenda y'obutaanyagurika, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />mwata omutima ahari ogwo ojwaire gye, muti; Ija oshutame aha aharungi; kandi mwagira omworo ogwo muti, Iwe! Yemerera kuriya! Nari shi, Shutama ahansi aha bigyere byangye; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />obwo nimuba muteetaaniisemu, mukaba abaramuzi abaine ebiteekateeko bibi? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:26">1 Kor 1:26</ref>. </char></note> Muhurire, B'eishe-emwe abarikukundwa. Abooro omu nsi egi, Ruhanga tarabatooraine kuba abatungi omu kwikiriza, n'okuba abahunguzi b'obukama obu yaaraganiise abarikumukunda? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Kwonka nimwanga mugaya ogwo mworo. Abatungi tibo babatwaza eikama, bakababindirana nibabata omu maramuriro? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Tibo barogota aha Iziina ry'ekitiinisa eri mweta?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muraabe nimuhitsya ekiragiro kya Mukama, ekyahandiikirwe ngu: Okunde mutaahi waawe nk'oku oyekunda, nimukora gye. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:17">Bir 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku murikushoroora omu bantu, nimuba musiisire, nimwomeserezibwa Ebiragiro nk'abasiisi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ahakuba omuntu weena orikuhitsya Ebiragiro byona, akashobyaho kimwe, naaba ashobize byona. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ahabw'okuba Owaagizire ati: otarishambana, niwe yaagizire ati: Otariita. N'ahabw'ekyo n'obu orikuba otashambaine, kwonka okaita, nooba oshobize Ebiragiro. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ahabw'ekyo mugambe kandi mukore, nk'abantu abaricwerwa orubanja Ebiragiro by'obusingye. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:7">Mat 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:34">18:34</ref>. </char></note> Otasaasira aryacwerwa orubanja atarikusaasirwa; kwonka embabazi zeehimbisiza aha rubanja.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwikiriza okutaine kukora n'okwa busha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mat 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:29">21:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, nikigasha ki omuntu kugira ngu aine okwikiriza, haza ataine kukora? Okwikiriza okwo nikubaasa kumujuna? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Mbwenu ku haakubaho ow'eishe-emwe, omushaija nari omukazi, otaine by'okujwara nari eby'okurya, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:17">1 Yoh 3:17</ref>. </char></note> omwe ahariimwe yaabagira ati: Mugyende n'obusingye, mutagate, muhaagye, haza atabahaire by'okuhwera emibiri yaabo, kikaabagasira ki? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />N'okwikiriza kwonka, ku kuba kutaine kukora, kuba kufiire.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shana omuntu akaagira ati: Iwe oine okwikiriza, nyowe nyine okukora. Mbwenu nyoreka okwikiriza kwawe okutaine kukora; naanye nkworekye okwikiriza kwangye okurikureeberwa omu bi ndikukora. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:7">Mak 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Iwe oikiriza ngu Ruhanga n'omwe; ekyo ni kirungi. Nangwa na baadaimoni bakiikiriza, nibatetema. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Iwe mushema 'we, nooyenda kworekwa okwikiriza okutaine kukora ku kuri okufiire? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:9">Kut 22:9</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Torikumanya ngu Abrahamu tatenkuriitwe akaihwaho orubanja ahabw'okukora, obu yaahayo omutabani Isaaka aha itambiro? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17">Heb 11:17</ref>. </char></note> Waareeba oku okwikiriza kwe kwagyendeire hamwe n'okukora, kandi ahabw'okukora, okwikiriza kwe kukahika; <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Kut 15:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ekyahandiikirwe kikahikiirizibwa ekirikugira ngu: Abrahamu akaikiriza Ruhanga, kyamubarirwa kuba okuhikiirira; kandi yaayetwa munywani wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:12">Rom 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Mwareeba omuntu oku aihwaho orubanja ahabw'okukora, kutari kwikiriza kwonka. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Yos 2:1-21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi na Rahabu maraaya taraihirweho orubanja ahabw'okukora, obu yaakunira entumwa, akazigarura omuhanda ogundi? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:17">Yak 2:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nk'omubiri ogutarimu mwoyo oku guba gufiire, nikwo n'okwikiriza okutaine kukora kuba kufiire.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi k'orurimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />B'eishe-emwe, mutariikiriza baingi omuriimwe kuhinduka abeegyesa; ahakuba nimumanya ngu itwe abeegyesa turyacwerwa orubanja orurikukira ez'abandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:26">Yak 1:26</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba twena tushobya omuri bingi; omuntu weena otashobya mu kugamba, ogwo n'omuntu ohikire, naabaasa kutegyeka n'omubiri gwona. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Nimumanya ngu, ku tuta ebyoma omu kanwa k'embaraasi, ngu zitworobere, tuhindura emibiri yaazo yoona. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kandi mureebe n'emeeri; n'obu ziraabe ziri mpango munonga, kandi nizitwarwa omuyaga gw'amaani, kwonka zihindurwa akabaho kakye munonga, kuza ei omuvugi arikwenda yoona. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />N'orurimi narwo nikwo ruri; n'akagingo kakye, akeehimbisa omu bintu bikuru. Mureebe ekibira n'obu kiraabe kiri kihango kita, kitwekwa akariro kakye! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:11">Mat 15:11</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 15:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:36">12:36</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:37">37</ref>. </char></note> N'orurimi ruba omuriro. Orurimi n'ensi mbi etuura omu ngingo zaitu, rushiisha omubiri gwona, rwotsya obuzaarwa bw'obuntu bwaitu bwona, kandi narwo rwokibwa Gehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Nimumanya ngu emiringo yoona ey'enyamaishwa n'ebirikuguruka, ebirikwekurura n'eby'omu nyanja, nibibaasa kutegyekwa kandi bikaba bitegyekwa abantu; <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">Zab 140:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:3">141:3</ref>. </char></note> kwonka tihariho muntu orikubaasa kutegyeka orurimi; n'obubi obutatuuza, rwijwire obushegu oburikwita. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Nirwo tuhimbisisa Mukama Isheboona, kandi nirwo tukyeenesa abantu, abahangirwe omu kishushani kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Omu kanwa kamwe harugamu okuhimbisa n'okukyeena. B'eishe-emwe, ebyo tibishemerire kuba bityo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Enshuro neebaasa kurugwamu amaizi amarungi n'agarikushaarira? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />B'eishe-emwe, omutiini nigubaasa kwana emizeituuni, nari omuzaabibu kwana emitiini? Nikwo n'amaizi g'omwonyo gatabaasa kurugwamu amarungi.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pet 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuriimwe n'oha oine obwengye, orikwetegyereza? Ahabw'emitwarize ye mirungi ayorekye emirimo ye n'obwengye oburimu obucureezi. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:31">Efe 4:31</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muraabe mwine eihari ry'obushaarizi n'okweyendeza omu mitima yaanyu, murekye kwehimbisa n'okubeiha, mukarwanisa amazima. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Obwengye obwo ti bwengye oburikuruga omu iguru, kureka n'obw'ensi, n'obw'abantu-buntu, n'obwa baadaimoni. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ahakuba ahu eihari n'okweyendeza biri, niho haba okurabanamu n'okukora kubi kwona. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Kwonka obwengye oburikuruga omu iguru, okubanza buba obushemeire, kandi obw'obusingye, obw'okutwaza gye, obwikiriza okuteisibwa, obwijwire embabazi n'ebyana ebirungi, obutarimu kugambira habiri n'obu bwakuba obugobya. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:17">Isa 32:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:9">Mat 5:9</ref>. </char></note> Abareeta obusingye babiba embibo omu busingye ezireeta ebyana by'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ekireeta engamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Engamba n'endwano eziri omuriimwe niziruga hi? Tizirikuruga omu kwetenga okubi okurikurwanira omu ngingo zaanyu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mwetenga, timuheebwa; n'ekirugamu mwita; kandi mukwatwa eihari, timubaasa kutunga; n'ekirugamu murwana, kandi muhurura. Ekibazibira kuheebwa n'okutashaba. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Mushaba, timuheebwa, ahakuba mushaba kubi kubikoresa okwetenga kwanyu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:7">Rom 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:15">1 Yoh 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Imwe bashambani 'mwe, timurikumanya ngu omukago gw'ensi n'obuzigu ahari Ruhanga? N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu okunda kuba munywani w'ensi, aba ayehindwire omuzigu wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Nari nimugira ngu Ebyahandiikirwe bigambira busha obu bigira biti: Omwoyo ogu yaatuhaire kutuura omuriitwe tagugirira bwiko? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Enf 3:34</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:5">1 Pet 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka akanyisa omugisha. Nikyo bigirira biti: Ruhanga arwanisa abaine amaryo, kwonka abacureezi abaha omugisha. <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:9">1 Pet 5:9</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mworobere Ruhanga. Murwanise Sitaane, aryabahunga. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:3">Zek 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Mwirire haihi Ruhanga, nawe abone kubairira haihi. Munaabe engaro zaanyu, imwe abasiisi; mushemeze emitima yaanyu imwe abaine emitima ebiri. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mushaashe, mucure, murire; okusheka kwanyu kuhindukye okucura, n'okushemererwa kwanyu kuhindukye okuganya. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:6">1 Pet 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Mwecureeze omu maisho ga Mukama, nawe aryabatunguura.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />B'eishe-emwe, mutarigambuurana. Orikugambuura mwene ishe, nari orikumucwera orubanja, naaba agambire kubi aha Biragiro, kandi abicwereire orubanja. Kwonka ku orikucwera Ebiragiro orubanja, nooba otarikworobera Biragiro, kureka ori omucwi w'emanja. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:4">Rom 14:4</ref>. </char></note> Hariho Omwe owaataireho Ebiragiro, kandi omucwi w'emanja; niwe arikubaasa kujuna kandi n'okucwekyereza. Mbwenu iwe niiwe oha orikucwera mutaahi waawe orubanja?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:1">Enf 27:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhurire, imwe abarikugira muti: Eri izooba nari nyencakare nitwija kuza omuri tauni nanka nari nanka, tumareyo omwaka gumwe nitushuubuza, tutungye enshaagi; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:20">Luk 12:20</ref>. </char></note> haza mutarikumanya ekiraabeho nyencakare. Amagara gaanyu ni ki? Muri nk'oruho orureebwa akaanya kakye, bwanyima rukaamuuka. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Kureka mukaagizire muti: Mukama waitu ku arikunda, turyagumaho tukore eki na kiriya. <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Kwonka hati nimwesiimira omu kwehimbisa kwanyu; haza okwesiima kwona nk'okwo ni kubi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:47">Luk 12:47</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu orikumanya kukora ebirungi, atabikore, ahariwe kiba kibi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibi ky'abatungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:24">Luk 6:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu naimwe abatungi, murire, muboroogye ahabw'enaku ezi mwaza kureeba. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:19">Mat 6:19</ref>. </char></note> Obutungi bwanyu bujunzire, n'ebijwaro byanyu biriirwe ebiyenje. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ezaabu zaanyu n'efeeza zikyereenyire, n'omukyereenyo gwazo guryabashinja, kandi gurye emibiri yaanyu nk'omuriro. Mukeebiikira eitungo ahabw'ebiro by'aha muheru. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:5">Mal 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ebihembo byabagyesi b'emisiri yaanyu, ebi mwabaimire ahabw'obugobya, nibibarega; kandi n'okurira kw'abashaaruuzi kuhikire omu matu ga Mukama ow'amahe. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:19">Luk 16:19</ref>. </char></note> Mukatuura omu nsi omu kwegira gye n'omu kweshemeza; mukahaazya emitima yaanyu aha kiro ky'okwitwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mukacwera ohikiriire orubanja, mwamwita, tiyaabangira.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugisha ogurikuruga omu kugumisiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:23">Yoel 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:36">Heb 10:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo B'eishe-emwe, mugumisirize okuhitsya ahu Mukama waitu ariizira. Reeba, omuhingi ategyereza emyaka ei yaahingire ey'obuguzi bwingi, agigumisiririza okuhitsya obu etunga enjura ey'eibiba n'eya katumba. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Naimwe mugumisirize. Mugumye emitima yaanyu; ahabw'okuba okwija kwa Mukama waitu kuri haihi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />B'eishe-emwe, mutaryetomboiterana, nyentsya mutaricwerwa orubanja; reeba, Omucwi w'emanja ayemereire aha rwigi. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:12">Mat 5:12</ref>. </char></note> B'eishe-emwe, baanabi abaabagambiire omu iziina rya Mukama, mubatware nk'eky'okureeberaho eky'okubonabona n'okugumisiriza. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yob 1:21</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Zab 103:8</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu abagumisiriza tubeeta abahiiriirwe. Mukahurira aha kugumisiriza kwa Yobu, kandi mwareeba eki Mukama yaagyendereire, oku aine embabazi nyingi n'okusaasira.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mat 5:34-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ekirikukira byona, B'eishe-emwe, mutarirahira eiguru n'obu yaakuba ensi nari okundi kurahira kwona, kureka ekigambo kyanyu kibe Eego, Eego, nari Ngaaha, Ngaaha; mutakaagyibwaho orubanja.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho gw'okushaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Omuriimwe harimu orikushaasha? Ashabe. Harimu oshemereirwe? Ayeshongore eby'okuhimbisa. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Mak 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Omuriimwe harimu orwaire? Atume aha bakuru b'ekanisa, bamushabire, bamusiigye amajuta omu iziina rya Mukama; <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mak 16:18</ref>. </char></note> n'okushaba okurimu okwikiriza kuryakiza ogwo orwaire, Mukama amwimutsye; kandi ku araabe aine ebibi ebi akozire, aryabisaasirwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo mweteisizane ebibi byanyu, kandi mushabirane, mubone kukira. Okushaba kw'ohikiriire kugira amaani maingi omu kukora kwakwo. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:25">Luk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>. </char></note> Eliya akaba ari omuntu nkaitwe; yaashaba munonga ngu enjura erekye kugwa; n'enjura yaamara emyaka eshatu n'ameezi mukaaga etarikugwa ha nsi. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42">1 Bag 18:42</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaashaba, eiguru ryagwisa enjura, eitaka ryameza emyaka yaaryo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />B'eishe-emwe, omuntu weena omuriimwe ku araahabe, yaaruga omu mazima, ondiijo yaamugarura, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:13">Zab 51:13</ref>. </char></note> mumanye ngu orikuhindura omusiisi akamwiha omu muhanda ogu yaahabiiremu, aryaba akirize amagara ge okufa, kandi aryaba ashwekire ebibi bingi munonga.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>